Future PoL Integration:
HPOT is committed to becoming an accelerator for PoL. HPOT not only built a liquidity-based LaunchPad for MEME but also made toolboxes for the long-term support of MEME tokens to help them integrate into PoL.
1. HPOT will convert all users participating in MEME Launch into Liquidity Providers;
2. Each MEME Launch is set with liquidity management tools provided by AquaBera;
3. HPOT have integrated Yeet's bon for all MEME to help them obtain self-built liquidity;
4. HPOT have integrated Gummi's lending protocol for some high-quality MEMEs;
5. HPOT and InterPoL jointly provide toolboxes for the LP lock-up of these MEMEs;
6. HPOT provide batch listing on CEX for MEMEs with FDV > 50m by fair launch;
7. We provide BGT Station's integrated toolset and Infrared's integrated toolset for high-quality MEMEs;

